<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices</p>
<p>and additional duties on imports effective July 23.</p>
<p>			 Representative price</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     24.93     23.89	  3.83-9.07  4.35-9.59</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     24.93     23.89	  3.67-8.64  4.16-9.16</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     28.68     27.55	 10.89	11.46</p>
<p> White sugar	  28.68     27.55	  6.37	 6.94</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.29	0.28	  0.36	 0.37</p>
</text>
